  "description": {
    "text": "The 2010 Pokémon World Championships, held from 13 to 15 August 2010 at the Hilton Waikoloa Village in Hawaii. Competitors got Tropical Tidal Wave in seven languages, staff a Staff copy, and top finishers copies stamped with their placing from Top Thirty-Two up to Finalist.\n\nThe top three of each age division received No. 1 to No. 3 Trainer trophy cards, this year in the HeartGold & SoulSilver era's frame.",
